-- statement:
--   For the actual same-process spectrally negative Lévy X, admissible dividends D and τ=min(ruinTime,n), prove the independent unconditional expected bound ∫⁻ ENNReal.ofReal(Term+Cash) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal(w x), with exact post-rightlimit W, Iic paymentTimes dividendMeasure Cash, and positive creeping terminal. This is the independent stochastic core reduction of the canonical five-witness theorem fdb9a6a3, with no added assumptions or downstream import.
-- source:
